#!golden 1
#!case chassis_identify_help
#!section exit
1
#!section stdout
#!section stderr
chassis identify <interval>
                 default is 15 seconds
                 0 to turn off
                 force to turn on indefinitely
#!section requests
> netfn=0x2c lun=0x00 cmd=0x00 target_cmd=0x00 data=00
< rule=default ccode=0xc1 len=0 data=
> netfn=0x2c lun=0x00 cmd=0x00 target_cmd=0x00 data=03
< rule=default ccode=0xc1 len=0 data=
bye
